text The remaining time...
text I don't know how much time she has left.
text What will become of her when that moment arrives? I don't want to think about that.
text Still, I've decided to be by her side as long as time allows me to.
text Fuko's tirelessly working on her starfish mission.
text I will keep on chasing away those who make fun of her existence.
text Fuko is desperate.
text I, too, am desperate.
text But...
text @[Tomoya]
text (Ah... Just what kind of reality is this...)
text Overwhelmed, I have to lean against the wall.
text Everything's different from yesterday.
