text @[Akio]
text Yo! Welcome back, you two.
text @[Tomoya]
text We're home.
text *Bow*
text Next to me, Fuko is bowing down.
text The old man is still able to see her.
text Even though he always seems so indifferent, he's one of the people who really cares about Fuko.
text Because I'm sure those with the weakest connection to her are the first to forget.
text Perhaps... I may even forget before he does.
sound 4VH.aac
text @[Akio]
text Hey, Fuko, want to take a bath together today, too?
text @[Tomoya]
text Whaaaat?!
text His shocking statement sends me looking between their faces.
